---
description: Protect the Figma reference and control how code is migrated from it.
globs:
alwaysApply: true
---

- `_DO_NOT_EDIT_figma-reference` is strictly read-only.
- Never create, modify, format, rename, move, delete, or install dependencies inside the reference directory.
- All implementation changes belong in `combat-training-app`.
- Use the reference for approved visuals, layout, hierarchy, icon shapes, and intended interactions.
- Do not copy prototype business logic blindly.
- Rewrite routing, persistence, timer logic, execution tracking, backend access, and validation.
- Reproduce an approved screen before proposing UX improvements.
- Any redesign must be proposed separately and requires approval.
- Preserve snapshots or screenshots when visual parity needs verification.
